@{
    Layout = "_CustomerLayout";
}
@*
    The customer layout is the default, and after Slice 7's scaffold removal it is the only one.

    This matters as a fail-safe rather than as tidiness: every page this application serves is read
    by an anonymous link holder, so a page that forgets to declare a layout must inherit the safe
    one — no scripts, no navigation, German. Each page still names it explicitly, so changing this
    line alone cannot silently move a customer page onto something else.
*@
